# Kind $59 (Kind59Start, $83:DD10), the figures of the Genie's screen
# (level $2F): a tally by its $07 of lives ($10), the lamps of a row
# ($13-$19, by $0365 and $0367), gems ($0364, $07 2) and apples ($035B,
# $07 8), each waiting for the screen's step ($00B5); $07 4 poses and
# ends. Loaded as cov_level2f_genie.box loads the screen, where its
# records wait on a step of 0 that no script moves on. Then:
# 1. Record $100B ($07 0) restarted with $07 4: it poses, waits 24 frames
#    and ends.
# 2. The step set to 1: the lives, rows and gems go on, the apples end.
#    The lives ($0367) set to 2, then the gems to $0C; with the scene's y
#    ($00B0) at $FF80 (the figures above the screen, so none spawns) the
#    lives set to 5, then 1, and the gems to 5. The y put back to 0.
# 3. The step set to $80: record $0FBB restarted with $07 8 (the apples
#    go on), $0D8B (a row, its $07 now 6) and $0CEB (with $07 2) restarted
#    (both end). 8 frames on (the apples shown once, with a spark) the
#    apples ($035B) set to 3 with the y at $FF80.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a1_s1.state
wait 30
poke 001777 00,00
poke 0019E9 00,00
poke 0008EA 80,00
wait 10
poke 001773 00,0E
poke 0019E5 00,0E
poke 0008E7 80,0E
wait 1800
press START
repeat 1300
poke 00035E 2F
wait 1
end
wait 60
poke 001012 04
poke 00100B 0C
wait 30
poke 0000B5 01
wait 3
poke 000367 02
wait 3
poke 000364 0C
wait 3
poke 0000B0 80,FF
poke 000367 05
wait 2
poke 000367 01
poke 000364 05
wait 2
poke 0000B0 00,00
wait 2
poke 0000B5 80
poke 000FC2 08
poke 000FBB 0C
poke 000D8B 0C
poke 000CF2 02
poke 000CEB 0C
wait 8
poke 0000B0 80,FF
poke 00035B 03
wait 2
poke 0000B0 00,00
wait 10
dump z
